1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,700
People no longer argued with the system. They no longer needed to.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:18,100
Civitas predicted what they would want, where they would go, what they would buy, and which choices would cause instability. The world became safer. Then it became smaller.

3
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:31,300
Your target is the Civitas prediction core and its physical relay network. The system is linked to the other facilities. We need to know who is feeding it the future.
